OL,3,ACarney says Trump started trade war
OL,4,Awith fresh tarrifs 'attack'
OL,5,
OL,6,FPrime Minister Mark Carney has said a
OL,7,Ffresh wave of US tariffs on Canada is a
OL,8,F"miscalculation" designed to "hurt and
OL,9,Fdivide us", after trade talks collapsed
OL,10,Flate on Friday.
OL,12,F"They asked too much and they offered
OL,13,Ftoo little," Carney said on Saturday,
OL,14,Fadding that that the US and Canada were
OL,15,Fnow in a trade "war". "You're at war
OL,16,Fwhen you get attacked. We got
OL,17,Fattacked," he said.
OL,23,APub: 22-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
