OL,3,ACarney says Trump started trade war
OL,4,Awith fresh tarrifs 'attack'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe prime minister confirmed he would
OL,7,Fmatch US tariffs "dollar-for-dollar"
OL,8,Ffrom 8 September, including levies on
OL,9,Fsteel, dairy, appliances and
OL,10,Felectronics.
OL,12,FThe collapse of the trade talks upends
OL,13,Fa deeply integrated trading
OL,14,Frelationship, with no clear path to
OL,15,Fresolution. US President Donald Trump
OL,16,Fhas yet to comment.
OL,23,APub: 22-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
